# §11.4.30 / CONST-053 repository hygiene.
#
# Model weights (the Kokoro ONNX graph and the voice pack, ~338 MiB together)
# are NEVER versioned — they are published third-party artefacts pulled on
# demand. §11.4.77 regeneration mechanism:
# .gitignore-meta/kokoro_onnx.yaml (download from the cited sources) plus the
# harness setup step.
models/
*.onnx
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth

# Python caches / build artefacts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
